title: 'C-c v b : skg-org-body-toggle'
pid: 8ddb9d10-faa1-4f8f-b2a9-af22657547ff
body: |2-
  Toggles the visibility of the body of the headline at point without
  folding its children. If the whole headline is folded, the command
  shows its body and immediate children, but leaves each child's entry
  folded. Works from the headline or from inside its body; called from
  the body, point moves to the start of the headline. A bodyless
  headline is left alone unless its children need to be revealed.
